{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e20bd6006945d2801436","chatId":"97e3147a568e4569b82209a7553d693c","sessionId":null,"userId":57829,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[D]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[D]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":988,"promptTokens":1520,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:31"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01798213804460873,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e20bd6006945d2801434","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368011316,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e20bd6006945d2801434","chatId":"97e3147a568e4569b82209a7553d693c","sessionId":null,"userId":57829,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n在学校的新年礼物交换活动中，李明珠非常期待送给同学王浩一个她精心挑选的礼物。张老师组织了这个活动，鼓励学生们互赠有心意的礼物。李明珠错过了张老师提醒大家注意食物过敏的时刻，因此她选择了一盒精美的手工月饼。交换礼物时，李明珠把礼物递给王浩，高兴地说：“这个月饼是我们这的特产，我记得你说过喜欢试试地方特色的点心！”王浩停顿了一下，然后礼貌地回答：“哦，谢谢你，明珠。我肯定会尝一尝的。”张老师轻声说道：“每份礼物都是对方的心意，我们接下来看看其他同学的礼物吧。”\n\n[问题]\n李明珠送给王浩什么礼物？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 巧克力\nB. 特产糖果\nC. 一本书\nD. 手工月饼","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01798213804460873,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e20bd6006945d2801436","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368011313,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:33:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b30544c800ba4cb1826263669870c484"}